---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ph } from '../data/ph';
const P = (s: string) => ph(s);
---
<Base title="Terms of Use | Marquis Harmon" description="Terms of Use for bigpicturearchitect.com, operated by Marquis Alan Experience LLC.">
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap stack g22 legal" style="max-width:720px">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem)">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Last updated: <b set:html={P('[date]')} /></p>
    <p>This website, bigpicturearchitect.com (the "Site"), is operated by <b>Marquis Alan Experience LLC</b>, a Texas limited liability company operating remotely ("we," "us"). By using the Site you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use it.</p>
    <h3>Use of this site</h3>
    <p>The Site provides information about the keynotes, workshops, coaching, and productions offered by Marquis Harmon. Content is for general information and may change without notice. You may use the Site only for lawful purposes and may not interfere with its operation or security.</p>
    <h3>No professional advice; coaching is not therapy</h3>
    <p>Content on the Site is not legal, financial, tax, investment, medical, or mental health advice. Coaching offered by Marquis Alan Experience LLC is not therapy, counseling, or medical care, and we do not diagnose or treat any condition. If you are in crisis or thinking about harming yourself, call or text 988 or call 911.</p>
    <h3>Inquiries and applications</h3>
    <p>Submitting an inquiry or application does not create a booking, a coaching relationship, or a contract. Engagements are confirmed only through a written agreement signed by both parties.</p>
    <h3>Intellectual property</h3>
    <p>All text, images, frameworks (including the G.O.D. Framework and the 7 Layer Strategy), and branding on the Site are owned by Marquis Alan Experience LLC or used with permission. You may not copy, reproduce, republish, or use them to train an AI system without our written consent.</p>
    <h3>Your submissions</h3>
    <p>By submitting a form you confirm that you are at least 18 years old and that the information you provide is accurate. Please do not include medical details, confidential third-party information, or emergency requests in a form, because forms are not monitored in real time.</p>
    <h3>Third-party links and services</h3>
    <p>The Site may link to or rely on third-party services. We are not responsible for their content or practices.</p>
    <h3>Disclaimers</h3>
    <p>We make reasonable efforts to keep the Site accurate and available, but we provide it "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind, to the fullest extent the law allows. We do not guarantee any particular business, financial, personal, or emotional result from any offering.</p>
    <h3>Limitation of liability</h3>
    <p>To the fullest extent the law allows, Marquis Alan Experience LLC is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>
    <h3>Governing law and venue</h3>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, where Marquis Alan Experience LLC is registered, without limiting any mandatory consumer protections of the state where you live, including Pennsylvania. Any dispute will be brought in the state or federal courts located in <b set:html={P('[a county in Texas to be named by your attorney, or Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania if you live in Pennsylvania]')} />. <b set:html={P('[Attorney to confirm.]')} /></p>
    <h3>Changes</h3>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The current version is always on this page, and your continued use of the Site means you accept it.</p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>Marquis Alan Experience LLC<br />Email: <b><a href="mailto:book@bigpicturearchitect.com">book@bigpicturearchitect.com</a></b></p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
